      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Is there a problem with using multiple [Animation Layers](https://docs.unity3d.com/2018.4/Documentation/Manual/AnimationLayers.html)? You can have many Animation Layers in any given Playable Layer. \nYou should not be attempting to put everything into a single layer.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
