      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name}: \nThankyou for reply\nYes, I'm very aware of that.\nthis feedback\nfor example, implemented multiple roles in one animation controller,\nIn the case, problem is that it is less portable to other avatars.\nWe need to make sure that each avatar has its own expression blend shape, inventory system, etc.\nit is a lot of use.\nthink there is a big advantage to be able to assign multiple animation controllers by role.\nFor example, when distribute a gimmick like the inventory system.\nUsers do not need to edit existing FX layer controllers, just add them to the list will be able to do this.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
