      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Tupper - VRChat Head of Community: \nCurrently you need to provide tools (like VRLabs Avatar3.0 Manager) and include instructions to merge multiple independent systems like prefabs. Doing this merging process manually is incredibly tedious and complex and even when using those tools its still rather tedious.\nHowever this would not just effect animators but also the expression parameters and menus.\nI suppose as AV3 wasnt designed with this in mind, it would be a rather complex design change. But a welcome one.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
