  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-13T04:11:18.622Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The current specification, large number of animations to be registered to a single controller for the FX layer.\nAs it is, it's difficult to divert controllers across avatars.\nI'd like to be able to define controllers at a finer granularity\nWant added the ability to register multiple animation controllers to the FX layer (like list).\nExample, \nFacial expression controller, inventory management controller, Movement Mode Controller ... and more",
